01:03:01.820 --> 01:03:19.339
Anders Elowsson: And so, ideally, we would have this situation where we used to spend around 50% on execution gas and 50% on state gas, and in this case, we can do this EIP8368. However, we might find ourselves in a situation where demand for state creation is relatively low.

426
01:03:20.180 --> 01:03:26.749
